      en: ["Located at the mouth of the Jubba River", "Capital of the autonomous Jubaland region", "Third largest city in Somalia by population", "Major deep-water port on the Indian Ocean", "Equatorial climate with high humidity", "The Bajuni Islands are located nearby"],
